WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.140
- The first thing I thought as a singer

00:00:02.140 --> 00:00:03.510
having to do videos all the time

00:00:03.510 --> 00:00:06.480
and having to time things with the lyrics,

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:09.370
when you did the entrance and the song,

00:00:09.370 --> 00:00:11.360
I was like, how many times
did you have to do that?

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:13.999
- I think 27 was the
official take on the day,

00:00:13.999 --> 00:00:14.832
because Fred--
- Was that, like,

00:00:14.832 --> 00:00:17.700
one of the hardest ones?
- Fred had fourteen years

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:18.620
in order to figure this out.

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:19.680
It was nearly impossible.

00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:21.700
You'd think that song
will last a long time.

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:22.533
- It's not.
- That song does not

00:00:22.533 --> 00:00:25.080
last a long time when you
gotta carry a thing in,

00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:27.210
take off a jacket, open closet door,

00:00:27.210 --> 00:00:28.580
pull a sweater off a hanger,

00:00:28.580 --> 00:00:30.187
put the jacket on the hanger,
- I had a mini panic attack

00:00:30.187 --> 00:00:31.020
watching it.

00:00:31.020 --> 00:00:34.187
- Mari, the boss, Mari
Heller, our director,

00:00:34.187 --> 00:00:37.800
she confessed to me later
on that she blew it,

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:38.950
that she could've made it easier

00:00:38.950 --> 00:00:42.420
because she found out
that Fred's blue shoes

00:00:42.420 --> 00:00:44.667
were already halfway tied.

00:00:44.667 --> 00:00:45.500
(Kelly gasps)

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:46.940
They were bigger than his feet anyway,

00:00:46.940 --> 00:00:48.740
so they went on really easy,

00:00:48.740 --> 00:00:51.300
then the shoes that come off
are also bigger than my feet,

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:54.750
so those come off easy, but
I had to do the full tie,

00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:57.448
you know, criss-cross
applesauce, you know.

00:00:57.448 --> 00:00:58.281
- I watched!

00:00:58.281 --> 00:00:59.970
- Rabbit goes around the ear.
- Yes!

00:00:59.970 --> 00:01:01.190
- I had to do that whole thing.

00:01:01.190 --> 00:01:03.840
He only had to do the fly

00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:05.809
around the rabbit's ear.
- Oh, my gosh!

00:01:05.809 --> 00:01:06.989
- It was a nightmare!

00:01:06.989 --> 00:01:07.839
(Kelly laughs)

